      "text": "You are in the Vault of Archavon, a vault entered from Wintergrasp Fortress in Wintergrasp. Archavon the Stone Watcher, Emalon the Storm Watcher and Toravon the Ice Watcher are its guardians. Warders of stone, storm and frost fill it.",
      "when": {
        "zone_id": 4603
      }
